From e37b813234e00335836385abb1dedc86cdf34a08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@aol.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:06:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 06/24] MSL: Add robust storage/uniform buffer access
 (robustBufferAccess2, null buffer descriptors)

Bounds-check loads, stores and atomics through buffer descriptors against the
descriptor range from the buffer size buffer: out-of-bounds reads return zero,
out-of-bounds writes and atomics are discarded. A null descriptor has range 0.
---
